# --- AgriSmart environment variables (all optional) ---

# Mandi (market) prices come from the Government of India open-data portal.
# The app ships with data.gov.in's public sample key and falls back to bundled
# sample data if the request fails (e.g. CORS / rate limit / offline).
# Get your own free key at https://data.gov.in/ and paste it here for reliable data.
VITE_DATA_GOV_API_KEY=579b464db66ec23bdd000001cdd3946e44ce4aad7209ff7b23ac571b

# Weather + location search use Open-Meteo, which is free and needs NO key.
